# Always revalidate pages, scripts and styles (a cheap 304 when unchanged). Without this, a phone can keep an old script or
# stylesheet while the page itself is new, so a deploy that changes HTML and JS together breaks for that visitor
# (blank scenes, unstyled cards). The JS and CSS files are not fingerprinted, so they must not be served from a stale copy.
/*.js
  Cache-Control: no-cache
/*.css
  Cache-Control: no-cache
/*.html
  Cache-Control: no-cache
